// Bullet speeds by caliber, after Shiptest. Only the plain gun calibers change: rockets, grenades,
// darts, arrows, rebar, foam, shrapnel, turrets and the bounty NPCs' own rounds keep their speeds.
// Damage is unchanged, so this is a straight buff to how hard bullets are to dodge.

